<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team regarding your experience on your flight from {{{Case.Departure_City__c}}} to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to high standards</strong><br />
<br />
We want you to enjoy a smooth and relaxing inflight experience every time you fly with us, so I'm sorry to hear you were dissatisfied with the beverages served on your recent flight.<br />
<br />
We place a high priority on both the quality and selection of beverages we serve onboard, and our Food and Beverage team work hard to choose options that everyone can enjoy.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
We are constantly reviewing our beverage menus, so I want to assure you that I’ve passed your comments on to the relevant team.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience — we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
